# .gitignore — Fincept Terminal (Qt6 / C++20)
# ============================================================

# ── CMake user presets (local paths — never commit) ─────────
CMakeUserPresets.json
fincept-qt/CMakeUserPresets.json

# ── CMake build output ───────────────────────────────────────
fincept-qt/build/
fincept-qt/build-*/
fincept-qt/build_*/
fincept-qt/tmpqt/
# clangd (.clangd → CompilationDatabase: .) expects compile_commands.json at the
# fincept-qt root; it's a local symlink into the active build dir (a build artifact).
fincept-qt/compile_commands.json
tmpqt/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
_deps/

# ── Compiled binaries & libraries ───────────────────────────
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
*.lib
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.pyd

# ── Qt generated files ───────────────────────────────────────
*.moc
moc_*.cpp
moc_*.h
qrc_*.cpp
ui_*.h
*.qm

# ── Python artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pdm-python
.pdm-build

# ── setup.sh runtime directories ─────────────────────────────
.qt/
.aqt-venv/

# ── IDE and editor ───────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.sln.docstates
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sw?
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
agents.md

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/

# ── Database files (runtime, not source) ─────────────────────
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ── Environment & secrets — NEVER commit ─────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.key
*.pub
# NOTE: *.pub is repo-wide and matches PUBLIC keys too. If the auto-updater
# ever ships its Ed25519 verification key as a file (rather than embedded in
# C++), it will be invisible to `git add` and absent from a fresh clone —
# add a `!` negation for that exact path at that time.

# ── Large data / ML model files ──────────────────────────────
# SCOPED to the Python analytics tree, which is where scripts write their
# outputs. These globs used to be repo-wide with no negations, which silently
# dropped any committed fixture: a .csv test input a script needs, a small
# .bin resource — invisible to `git add`, absent from a fresh clone and from
# CI, and impossible to notice until something fails at runtime. Build trees
# (fincept-qt/build*/) are already ignored above, so nothing generated there
# needs a second rule.
fincept-qt/scripts/**/*.csv
fincept-qt/scripts/**/*.bin
fincept-qt/scripts/**/*.pt
fincept-qt/scripts/**/*.onnx
fincept-qt/scripts/**/*.h5
fincept-qt/scripts/**/*.pkl
fincept-qt/scripts/**/*.pickle
fincept-qt/scripts/**/*.model
fincept-qt/scripts/**/*.weights

# ── Archives ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z

# ── Legacy / non-C++ build artifacts (defensive ignores) ─────
fincept-terminal-desktop/
fincept-cpp/
**/target/
*.rlib
*.rmeta
node_modules/
dist-ssr/

# ── Claude Code — never commit ───────────────────────────────
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
fincept-qt/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md

# ── Build output (uitest) ─────────────────────────────────────
fincept-qt/uitest/build/

# ── ML training artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────
lightning_logs/
*.ckpt
# `*.yaml` was here and is DELETED: it was repo-wide with no negations, so a
# workflow added as .github/workflows/foo.yaml, a flatpak/AppImage manifest,
# or any other YAML config would be silently untrackable — invisible to
# `git add` and simply missing from a fresh clone and from CI. Nothing in the
# repo was ever tracked as .yaml (verified), and the only .yaml on disk is
# CMakeConfigureLog.yaml inside an already-ignored build tree.

# ── Shell tree output files ───────────────────────────────────
**/tree

# ── Duplicate nested agents folder ───────────────────────────
fincept-qt/scripts/agents/agents/

# ── Firecrawl research artifacts ─────────────────────────────
.firecrawl/

# ── Clangd cache ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
fincept-qt/.cache/

# ── Exchange runtime cache ────────────────────────────────────
fincept-qt/scripts/exchange/.cache/

# ── Python test + bench caches ────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.benchmarks/

# ── Editor/refactor backups ───────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.orig
*.deleted
*.deleted.*

# ── Local SQLite databases ────────────────────────────────────
# (*.db is already covered above; adding sqlite variants)
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Internal planning docs ────────────────────────────────────
fincept-qt/docs/superpowers/
docs/superpowers/

# ── Grill-me session notes ────────────────────────────────────
.grill-me/
**/.grill-me/

# ── Local planning docs ───────────────────────────────────────
plans/
**/plans/

# ── Internal Crypto Center phase notes ────────────────────────
fincept-qt/docs/CRYPTO_CENTER_PHASE_2.md
fincept-qt/docs/CRYPTO_CENTER_PHASE_3.md
fincept-qt/docs/CRYPTO_CENTER_PHASE_4.md
fincept-qt/docs/CRYPTO_CENTER_PHASE_5.md
fincept-qt/docs/CRYPTO_WALLET_CONNECT.md

# ── Markdown files — only README.md is tracked ────────────────
*.md
!README.md
!**/README.md
!docs/LLM_AUTO_TRADER_DESIGN.md
build/
